{"id":"3f5171c34dbb4e9c","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-atomic-formula.md","title":"Atomic Formulas","display":"df-atomic-formula — Atomic Formulas","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-atomic-formula","aliases":["90-df-atomic-formula"],"display":"df-atomic-formula — Atomic Formulas","depends_on":["[[90-df-term]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-atomic-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-atomic-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-atomic-formula — Atomic Formulas"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"242d776aa7405493\" href=\"?note=242d776aa7405493\" title=\"90-df-term\">90-df-term</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)\">\\(\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)\\)</span>，其分量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_r\">\\(R_r\\)</span> 和项集见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"242d776aa7405493\" href=\"?note=242d776aa7405493\" title=\"90-df-term\">90-df-term</a>。等号是逻辑二元标记，不另列入关系符号集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=t\">\\(s=t\\)</span> 在对象公式位置表示树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=(s,t)\">\\(=(s,t)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(\\vec t)\">\\(R(\\vec t)\\)</span> 是有序子项列形成的原子公式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AtFml}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{=(s,t):s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\\}\\cup\n\\bigcup_{r\\ge1}\\{R(\\vec t):R\\in R_r\\land\\vec t\\in(\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda)^r\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AtFml}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;\\subseteq\\operatorname{Tree}_\\Lambda.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AtFml}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{=(s,t):s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\\}\\cup\n\\bigcup_{r\\ge1}\\{R(\\vec t):R\\in R_r\\land\\vec t\\in(\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda)^r\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AtFml}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;\\subseteq\\operatorname{Tree}_\\Lambda.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"242d776aa7405493","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"242d776aa7405493","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)$，其分量 $R_r$ 和项集见 [[90-df-term]]。等号是逻辑二元标记，不另列入关系符号集。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"R_r","display":false},{"tex":"s=t","display":false},{"tex":"=(s,t)","display":false},{"tex":"R(\\vec t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AtFml}^{88}_\\Lambda&\\coloneqq\n\\{=(s,t):s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\\}\\cup\n\\bigcup_{r\\ge1}\\{R(\\vec t):R\\in R_r\\land\\vec t\\in(\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda)^r\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AtFml}^{88}_\\Lambda&\\subseteq\\operatorname{Tree}_\\Lambda.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":981,"backlinks":[{"id":"695f658f5cc56144","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,